OL,3,A'Devastating message' as ANC records
OL,4,Aworst-ever result in South Africa
OL,5,Aelection
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth Africa's ANC has recorded its
OL,8,Fworst-ever showing in local elections
OL,9,Fsince Nelson Mandela led the country
OL,10,Fout of apartheid and into democracy
OL,11,Fmore than 30 years ago, a result the
OL,12,Fparty has called "catastrophic".
OL,14,FWhile it won the most votes of all
OL,15,Fparties in the country, the African
OL,16,FNational Congress won 31% of the
OL,17,Foverall vote, one third down from the
OL,18,F46% it gained in 2021, and a far cry
OL,19,Ffrom the 65% 20 years ago.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
