OL,3,A'Devastating message' as ANC records
OL,4,Aworst-ever result in South Africa
OL,5,Aelection
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe story of its decline is also clear
OL,8,Fin the provinces and cities. The party
OL,9,Fwon a majority in just one of the
OL,10,Fcountry's nine provinces, Limpopo. In
OL,11,F2021 it won six. It also won the most
OL,12,Fvotes in just two of the eight cities,
OL,13,Fcompared with six at the last local
OL,14,Felections.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
PN,31803
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1794214558
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Devastating message' as ANC records
OL,4,Aworst-ever result in South Africa
OL,5,Aelection
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Democratic Alliance (DA) came
OL,8,Fsecond in the overall vote with 25%,
OL,9,Fretaining majority control of the city
OL,10,Fof Cape Town. Former president Jacob
OL,11,FZuma's MK party came third overall with
OL,12,F10%, unseating the ANC as winner in the
OL,13,Fcity of Durban, while the Economic
OL,14,FFreedom Fighters (EFF), led by Julius
OL,15,FMalema, once seen as a serious
OL,16,Fchallenge to the ANC, came fourth with
OL,17,F6%.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
